    "description": "Export one locale's translations as a localization file and return its content as text. Free read. Formats: json_flat, json_nested, android_xml, ios_strings, ios_stringsdict, flutter_arb, laravel_php, laravel_json, xliff_12, ios_xcstrings, gettext_po, yaml, csv, xlsx, xliff_20, java_properties, resx, markdown, unity_csv, unreal_po. Optional min_state exports only values that are human_edited-or-better, or reviewed only. skipped_keys counts entries the chosen format cannot represent (e.g. plural keys in json_flat, simple keys in ios_stringsdict). On a project set to icu message syntax the server also withholds entries whose translation is not valid ICU MessageFormat, and reports how many in omitted_invalid_icu_keys, which is absent when the server did not check. Requires the "pull" ability.",
